      "comment": "FOOT FALCON (1) has been in sparkling form, last time showing brilliant early pace and proving too slick around Northam over 509m in 29.46, making it three wins on end. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Ideally placed to take this out. GREAT CHAT (4) has a strong record this trip with seven wins and three placings from 17 starts. Was out of placings last time (30.26) at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. Among the main chances. CHOOSING TEXAS (7) hit the frame latest (29.97) when third at Cannington in a Grade 5. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring three times. Suited here and expected to run well. CYPHER MONELLI (3) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fifth (28.68), beaten 15 lengths. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings.",
